        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Abbas Kiarostami, Stuart Baird, Mohammad-Ali Talebi, Kurt Russell, Steven Seagal, Halle Berry, Oliver Platt, David Suchet, John Leguizamo\n- Films: Willow and Wind, Executive Decision\n- Roles: film director, screenwriter, photographer, film producer, film editor\n- Topics: Iranian cinema, action films, thriller action films\n\nFacts:\n- Abbas Kiarostami was born on 22 June 1940 and died on 4 July 2016.\n- Stuart Baird was born on 30 November 1947.\n- Executive Decision is a 1996 American thriller action film directed by Stuart Baird in his directorial debut.\n- Executive Decision stars Kurt Russell, Steven Seagal, Halle Berry, Oliver Platt, David Suchet, and John Leguizamo.\n- Willow and Wind is a 2000 Iranian drama film directed by Mohammad-Ali Talebi.\n- Willow and Wind was written by Abbas Kiarostami.\n- Abbas Kiarostami was an Iranian film director, screenwriter, photographer, and film producer.\n- Stuart Baird is an English film editor, producer, and director mainly associated with action films.",
